Comment: 0,0:02:24.56,0:02:26.80,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵  喵  喵  喵  喵
Comment: 0,0:02:27.62,0:02:28.43,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HF5F4F5&\3c&H9A3AD9&}喵
Comment: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:34.21,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H3B2CD5&}太不可思議了...
Comment: 0,0:02:35.53,0:02:37.36,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}太超模了
Comment: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:40.28,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H088209&}令人無法抗拒
Comment: 0,0:02:43.17,0:02:46.17,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}在狹窄的道路上  我們巧合地相遇了
Comment: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:49.19,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFF2700&}立馬就被你那黑洞一樣的深邃眼神所吸引
Comment: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:51.24,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}你的冷漠、温柔和誇張
Comment: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:53.26,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HE618EA&}爲何會讓我心跳不已呢？？
Comment: 0,0:02:55.90,0:02:58.86,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}下午可能會下雨
Comment: 0,0:02:59.04,0:03:02.12,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H18179B&}不如提前去吃午飯吧
Comment: 0,0:03:02.20,0:03:05.36,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}在陽光下盡情享受著日光浴
Comment: 0,0:03:05.36,0:03:08.36,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HAB4ED9&}這小可愛到底是何方神聖
Comment: 0,0:03:09.18,0:03:12.40,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}從今往後  我都是屬於你的了
Comment: 0,0:03:12.40,0:03:15.48,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HA99400&}過度的深愛  讓時空也扭曲了
Comment: 0,0:03:15.48,0:03:19.38,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}不知不覺間  你已經成爲了我的宇宙
Comment: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:20.37,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}怦怦直跳心情
Comment: 0,0:03:20.37,0:03:21.78,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H0067F2&}讓我倍感煎熬...
Comment: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:24.95,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}説是命運也好  奇迹也罷
Comment: 0,0:03:24.95,0:03:28.02,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&HFA0F7E&}我們的相遇就是宇宙大爆炸
Comment: 0,0:03:28.02,0:03:31.95,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}夜空中懸吊的星星就是奇迹
Comment: 0,0:03:31.95,0:03:35.03,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H5D03FF&}純然的愛不需要自我
Comment: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:38.95,OPCH,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\c&H19A20C&}我只想一直陪在你的身邊...
